The licence above covers the code and the documentation.

It does not cover the name "Steward" or the arch mark in brand/, which are
kept separate on purpose. Fork the code freely; use your own name and your own
mark, so that nobody downloading a fork can be confused about who wrote it or
who to ask for support. That is the usual arrangement in open source and it
costs a forker nothing.

